{"title":"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Plugging_in_First)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Plugging in First)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Simplifying_First)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Simplifying First)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/e/6deb8b1933c0d64f38741bfb7df720dfe3d467c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^{4}+3x^{2}}{x^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Plugging_in_First.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Plugging_in_First)\">Solution 1 (Plugging in First)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Plugging in First)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805179f4f5d6a4dc0fb460b31878ae6e477d5a61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{4} + 3 \\times 2^{2}}{2^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7df48ed4df8e2c3ea14b41e91259f4e79c300b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{16 + 3 \\times 4}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e4084030f38d4112ec8546e03c1279bb490ef5aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{16 + 12}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/870d54cc1fbc00d1ed3665fa2d8273f4544ba4f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{28}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/0/c5070d494db10d2998ba533cc9ab439b3b2628a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Simplifying_First.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Simplifying_First)\">Solution 2 (Simplifying First)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Simplifying First)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/5/e558c6e2a654f69f68959e4748c1dec64ea99c83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^{4} + 3x^{2}}{x^{2}} = \\frac{x^{4}}{x^{2}} + \\frac{3x^{2}}{x^{2}} = x^{2} + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"245\" height=\"41\" />. \n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc6fd67459de3ded54d2510a7085e68b3336dee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e3a877a525c04535c606ada108043ec4c58516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2} + 3 = 4 + 3 = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"159\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2316/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.273      1 2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.273      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35988:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025601 and revision id 279578. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}